  "id": "demotivation",
  "term": "demotivation",
  "definition": "Demotivation is a psychological phenomenon in which a learner’s motivation for foreign language study is reduced or undermined. In this context, it refers to the factors and processes that weaken learners’ willingness to engage in foreign language learning.",
